## Modifications

This folder is a copy of the upstream skill, changed on 2026-11-10 by
https://github.com/a-ahandani/persianskills:

- Frontmatter brought to the repo's skill standard: the description is in the third person with trigger words, and `license` and `metadata` (author, source, upstream commit, changes) were added.
- Pointers to the `natural-farsi` skill, which this repo does not carry, now point to `persian-conversational`. The pointer to natural-farsi's technical-vocabulary list was dropped because `persian-conversational` has no such list; the rule to keep the user's English technical nouns in English is unchanged.
- The note on the UI locale no longer refers to the upstream app's webview.
- Renamed from finglish-normalize to persian-finglish to match the repo's naming rule: the folder, the `name` field and references to the skill's own name.
- Upstream repo files that agents don't load were removed, and the modification notes moved from MODIFIED.md into this file.

See CREDITS.md at the repo root for the source commit.
